# Secrets — never commit the pokemontcg.io API key
appsettings.Local.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.local

# Local data (your collection database + cached card images).
# Deliberately NOT a "data/" directory rule: Git on Windows matches paths
# case-insensitively, so "data/" also swallows the source folder server/Data/
# and silently drops Db.cs from the repo. The runtime data directory always
# sits next to the built binary, so bin/ and the publish folder already cover
# it; these patterns are the backstop.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Built frontend — regenerated by `npm run build`
server/wwwroot/

# .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user

# Node
node_modules/
client/dist/
npm-debug.log*

# A scratch copy of the brand artwork, dropped here when the logo is being
# changed. The committed source of truth is brand/CardVault.png, which
# tools/generate-icons.py reads — anything at the client root is a working copy.
#
# Ignored rather than deleted because it is otherwise picked up by `git add -A`,
# which has already put a 1.8 MB duplicate into an unrelated commit once, and
# because an untracked file makes tools/package.ps1 refuse to build a release.
client/logo.png

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
